<title>BELGIUM: BBL LOWERS MORTGAGE RATES.</title>
<headline>BBL LOWERS MORTGAGE RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Banque Bruxelles Lambert said it lowered mortgage rates, effective today.</p>
<p>    MATURITY	  NEW RATE	CHANGE</p>
<p>base rates</p>
<p>    10-years fixed  7.50 pct	-25 bp</p>
<p>    15-years fixed  7.65 pct	-25 bp</p>
<p>    20-years fixed  8.35 pct	-25 bp</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
